"><path d="M1.22461 0.198869L5.78989 4.51989C6.07004 4.78505 6.07004 5.21495 5.78989 5.48011L1.22461 9.80113C0.944465 10.0663 0.490258 10.0663 0.21011 9.80113C-0.0700368 9.53597 -0.0700368 9.10606 0.21011 8.8409L3.19825 5.88451L4.15473 4.9792L3.19825 4.07389L0.21011 1.1591C-0.0700368 0.893936 -0.0700368 0.464029 0.21011 0.198869C0.490258 -0.0662898 0.944465 -0.0662898 1.22461 0.198869Z" fill="#344854"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="_8034"><div class="_8xm7" data-ms="&#123;&quot;creative&quot;:&quot;listview-card&quot;,&quot;creative_detail&quot;:&quot;listview-card&quot;,&quot;create_type&quot;:&quot;listview-card&quot;,&quot;create_type_detail&quot;:&quot;listview-card&quot;&#125;"><div class="_8xis _8xhs"><div class="_8xm6"><div class="_8xm8"><p class="_8w6f _8w60 _8w6g">Blog</p></div><div class="_8xkp"><div class="_8xkn"><p class="_8w6f _8wl0 _8w6h">November 10, 2025</p></div></div><div class="_8xiz"><div class="_8xit"><div class="_8wpy"><div class="_8x6u"><h4 class="_8w6a _8w6e _8w60 _8xok _8x78">Open Source</h4></div></div><div class="_8wpz"><h4 class="_8w6a _8w6e _8w61">Omnilingual ASR: Advancing Automatic Speech Recognition for 1,600+ Languages</h4></div><div class="_8xkk"><p class="_8w6f _8xm4 _8w61 _8w6h">We’re introducing Meta Omnilingual Automatic Speech Recognition, a suite of models providing automatic speech recognition capabilities for over 1,600 languages.</p></div></div><div class="_8xix _8xiy"><div class="_8xkq"><div class="_8xkn"><p class="_8w6f _8xm4 _8wl0 _8w6h">November 10, 2025</p></div></div><div class="_8xkm"><p class="_8w6f _8xm4 _8wl0 _8w6h"></p><div class="_8xko"><a class="_8xc5 _8x97 _8w61" href="https://ai.meta.com/blog/omnilingual-asr-advancing-automatic-speech-recognition/" data-ms="&#123;&quot;creative&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;creative_detail&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;create_type&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;create_type_detail&quot;:&quot;link&quot;&#125;" data-lnfb-mode